{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "29d354db396899067d22d1c5d2b70a657c27e0c04dbb299e8ca5464357629ba9", "ja": "バラエティ番組のお仕事", "zh": "综艺节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4001_p", "source_sha256": "7d9bd3a640cdc9b0631eeb3c26527ffbba57e3149c1a459f1238c951f4c37c54", "ja": "エレナ、クイズ番組への出演が決まったぞ。\n結構有名な番組だから、気合いを入れて頑張ってくれ！", "zh": "艾琳娜，你接到猜谜节目的通告了喔。\n这是相当有名的节目，多加把劲努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4002_018ele", "source_sha256": "38d2455d1b6702665a0fbd514d730c92254cbea3f366c897d57d5e25a846dd0a", "ja": "ワオ！　楽しそうだネ～っ！\nクイズって、どんなコト聞かれるのかナ？", "zh": "哇哦！好像很有趣呢～！\n猜谜都会问些什么问题呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4003_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a8dd542f8aa0424f88630646f8c080c455d5a64ffaa0ec9fc7eec2e5ffb3ce6", "ja": "ワタシはねー……サッカーが好きだヨ！\nあとは、美味しいブラジル料理のコトとか～……。", "zh": "我啊……很喜欢足球喔！\n还有就是巴西的美食之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4004_p", "source_sha256": "50607309359932ebdc8695b1f7e85ec82c06d773717592881825d4d10f3fbb39", "ja": "うーん、どうだろうな。たぶん、得意なこと以外の\n問題が多いと思うけど……。", "zh": "嗯……很难说吧。我想应该会出现比较多\n你不擅长的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4005_018ele", "source_sha256": "7284ab3c20aa64147fe36ff862e27628ded3eec043fc422dc9a6bd628f22ef57", "ja": "ええ～！？\nそれじゃあ、カッコよく答えられないヨー？", "zh": "咦咦～！？\n这样子的话，我就不能很帅气地回答了耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4006_018ele", "source_sha256": "859fca0a84383503bd7acffda68cdd71fec9d26a7c608bfb44a1f4844fd0b38e", "ja": "……そうだ！　クイズマスターになればいいんだネ？\n{$P$}、クイズのレッスンしようヨ！", "zh": "……对了！只要变成猜谜大师就行了吧？\n{$P$}，来进行猜谜的训练课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4007_018ele", "source_sha256": "60a462e9ec320476e4e52669c656ca094340c9e1d63da28648319b871f5911e4", "ja": "あれ？　でもクイズのレッスンって、\n何をしたらいいのカナ……？", "zh": "咦？可是猜谜的训练课程，\n应该做些什么才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4008_p", "source_sha256": "717997f00c9fc5dcd30254802dcaed9b9512eb4823c70a107bd729f66c7f2a05", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4009", "source_sha256": "34f03fc20de78a072986d5dd83129c8010cd23102c100384e429380a8a305d3f", "ja": "雑学の本を読む", "zh": "读杂学书", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4010", "source_sha256": "eed7c78f2d4297fb56254a8db27b15d06512bf9286dd46fbb57756b5a2e3f79d", "ja": "クイズ番組を見る", "zh": "看猜谜节目", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4011", "source_sha256": "40f9dfc77994df912375509922cdd4ef3c2e5c09cb3ba152a20d1b5e05125a48", "ja": "寝る", "zh": "睡觉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4100_p", "source_sha256": "dfbe0e9137956dab8db0ea34497d6532e9a0d894c77a6af06f7e2c9b134febf9", "ja": "雑学の本を読むのはどうだ？　クイズに出なくても、\nためになることも多いし……一石二鳥じゃないか？", "zh": "读杂学书如何？就算没出现在谜题中，\n在其他方面也会很有帮助……不是一举两得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4101_018ele", "source_sha256": "4662641fc11fe5f7494cd4e78bcbcdef637e18070c5b62d018981d04b26b2151", "ja": "{$P$}、ナイスアイディアだヨ♪\nじゃあさっそく、本屋さんに行こっ。", "zh": "{$P$}，真是好主意♪\n那就赶快去书店吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4102_018ele", "source_sha256": "7bc00fc91c801c809b651689cd25df9c611127de3a2b89e9724a2d05ef3c5c88", "ja": "ワタシは、そういうのあんまり詳しくないから……\n{$P$}、オススメ選んでネっ♪", "zh": "我对这类的书不太清楚……\n{$P$}，要替我选推荐的书喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4200_p", "source_sha256": "c8f9f339d98f0fc95398b4823e7a65ad3a800f380b7633a91f51934df94b7d5f", "ja": "クイズ番組を見るのはどうだ？\n参考になると思うんだけど。", "zh": "看猜谜节目如何？\n我想应该能当作参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4201_018ele", "source_sha256": "606fef98f71a974ec12efb2dadc32457143ae7b75eeef54bdfe28b53faa09b41", "ja": "なるほど！　その手があったヨー。\nどんな番組があるか、チェックしてみないとだネ。", "zh": "原来如此！还有这一招啊～\n得去确认有哪些节目才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4202_018ele", "source_sha256": "2c77ecb70a606859eb91f11d8fbd03f16ccea5acea40c124eb39ed4bc74ed724", "ja": "へー、クイズって結構たくさんあるんだネ？\nえっと、『動物ふれあいモフモフクイズ』……？", "zh": "哦～原来猜谜节目有这么多种啊？\n呃……『与动物交流的毛茸茸猜谜』……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4203_018ele", "source_sha256": "72f7c8722f5a2d90a85be25a2749925686cc669a7ffb4f1abb6713e9559eb0c1", "ja": "{$P$}！\nワタシ、次はこの番組に出たいヨ～！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我下次想上这个节目啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4300_p", "source_sha256": "6964c3299db448b04bdecbe3d68c7b63a5b7c04d6e3e4a9f3c118015c963287c", "ja": "緊張していると、なかなか答えられないし……\n深く考えずに、あえて寝るのはどうだ？", "zh": "要是太紧张就很难答得出来了……\n别想太多，先去睡个觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4301_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ea58be5b9cb3f6dd84e973c2d5b885ad7438c132db2c04dccd1cee178b6820a", "ja": "ええ～！？　それじゃ、クイズに負けちゃうヨー！\nもうっ、{$P$}ってば～！", "zh": "咦咦～！？那样子猜谜会输的啦～！\n讨厌，{$P$}真是的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_4302_018ele", "source_sha256": "2478ac0f8f0dea4e6155a44fc26850b8b4424c6f9af2e54fe62316d099781226", "ja": "うー、何か良いアイディアないカナー。\nクイズの王様になれちゃうくらいの、スゴい裏技……！", "zh": "呜～就没有什么好主意了吗～\n可以让我成为猜谜王的超厉害秘技……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
